{"utterance_id": "UTT-071", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:06", "speaker_id": "C-FIN-001", "speaker_name": "王强", "text": "这块我们内部还在核。", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
{"utterance_id": "UTT-072", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:07", "speaker_id": "P-RM-001", "speaker_name": "张伟", "text": "没问题，这项我记成未获得，不做推断。", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
{"utterance_id": "UTT-073", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:07", "speaker_id": "C-PUR-001", "speaker_name": "陈涛", "text": "付款条件还在谈。", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
{"utterance_id": "UTT-074", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:08", "speaker_id": "C-PUR-001", "speaker_name": "陈涛", "text": "付款条件还在谈。", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
{"utterance_id": "UTT-075", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:09", "speaker_id": "C-PUR-001", "speaker_name": "陈涛", "text": "我刚过来，设备这块三家主供应商比较关键。", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
{"utterance_id": "UTT-076", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:09", "speaker_id": "C-PUR-001", "speaker_name": "陈涛", "text": "交付节点比价格更敏感。", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
{"utterance_id": "UTT-077", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:10", "speaker_id": "P-RM-001", "speaker_name": "张伟", "text": "陈总，最影响付款安排的是哪些条件？", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
{"utterance_id": "UTT-078", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:10", "speaker_id": "C-PUR-001", "speaker_name": "陈涛", "text": "供应商这块差异比较大。", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
{"utterance_id": "UTT-079", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:11", "speaker_id": "C-PUR-001", "speaker_name": "陈涛", "text": "伺服、精密传动交期都比较长，有些要提前锁单。三成预付款已经算谈过的。", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
{"utterance_id": "UTT-080", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:11", "speaker_id": "C-CFO-001", "speaker_name": "李明", "text": "等内部主体定了再确认。", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
{"utterance_id": "UTT-081", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:12", "speaker_id": "P-RM-001", "speaker_name": "张伟", "text": "供应商对票据或者供应链付款方式接受度怎么样？", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
{"utterance_id": "UTT-082", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:12", "speaker_id": "C-CFO-001", "speaker_name": "李明", "text": "方向可以先看。", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
{"utterance_id": "UTT-083", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:13", "speaker_id": "C-PUR-001", "speaker_name": "陈涛", "text": "不一样。有一家比较愿意接受票据，另外两家更看重现金和交期。", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
{"utterance_id": "UTT-084", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:13", "speaker_id": "C-FIN-001", "speaker_name": "王强", "text": "这块我们内部还在核。", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
{"utterance_id": "UTT-085", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:14", "speaker_id": "P-RM-001", "speaker_name": "张伟", "text": "那我们不会一刀切。王彬这边可以先做一个供应商接受度和付款工具对照，不影响采购谈判。", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
{"utterance_id": "UTT-086", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:14", "speaker_id": "C-FIN-001", "speaker_name": "王强", "text": "这个我回去让同事补一下。", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
{"utterance_id": "UTT-087", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:15", "speaker_id": "C-CFO-001", "speaker_name": "李明", "text": "可以看看，但不要搞得太复杂，不能影响设备交付。", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
{"utterance_id": "UTT-088", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:17", "speaker_id": "P-RM-001", "speaker_name": "张伟", "text": "明白，“简单、不影响交付”我会作为方案约束，不会只追求产品叠加。", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
{"utterance_id": "UTT-089", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:20", "speaker_id": "P-RM-001", "speaker_name": "张伟", "text": "另外如果项目放在智能制造公司，几家子公司之间现在资金调拨是不是比较分散？", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
{"utterance_id": "UTT-090", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:21", "speaker_id": "C-CFO-001", "speaker_name": "李明", "text": "是。集团本部、自动化、智能制造之间要财务每天协调。", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
{"utterance_id": "UTT-091", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:22", "speaker_id": "C-FIN-001", "speaker_name": "王强", "text": "每天看余额、转款、审批，确实比较费时间。", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
{"utterance_id": "UTT-092", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:23", "speaker_id": "P-RM-001", "speaker_name": "张伟", "text": "那现金管理可以作为并行课题，但不和这次融资审批绑定。先把账户和资金规则梳理清楚。", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
{"utterance_id": "UTT-093", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:24", "speaker_id": "C-CFO-001", "speaker_name": "李明", "text": "可以，先别铺太大。", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
{"utterance_id": "UTT-094", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:28", "speaker_id": "P-RM-001", "speaker_name": "张伟", "text": "我把今天确认和没确认的分开说一下。确认的：二期项目在推进；主体倾向智能制造公司但未最终过会；三千万是第一阶段设备款资金安排，不等同新增授信；付款考虑30/40/30。没确认的：最终项目主体、现有额度能否用于该项目、他行结构细节。这样对吗？", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
{"utterance_id": "UTT-095", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:29", "speaker_id": "C-CFO-001", "speaker_name": "李明", "text": "对。", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
{"utterance_id": "UTT-096", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:31", "speaker_id": "P-RM-001", "speaker_name": "张伟", "text": "接下来我建议两条路径并行做：集团本部统筹路径和项目公司融资路径。我们先做结构，不做审批承诺。", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
{"utterance_id": "UTT-097", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:32", "speaker_id": "C-CFO-001", "speaker_name": "李明", "text": "可以。", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
{"utterance_id": "UTT-098", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:35", "speaker_id": "P-RM-001", "speaker_name": "张伟", "text": "王总，设备清单能否7月10日前先给一版？我们用于测付款节奏，不作为审批材料。", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
{"utterance_id": "UTT-099", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:35", "speaker_id": "C-FIN-001", "speaker_name": "王强", "text": "可以。", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
{"utterance_id": "UTT-100", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:36", "speaker_id": "P-RM-001", "speaker_name": "张伟", "text": "我这边7月14日前给一版三年期结构建议。王彬补一个供应商付款工具对照。", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
{"utterance_id": "UTT-101", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:37", "speaker_id": "C-CFO-001", "speaker_name": "李明", "text": "没问题。方案先做结构，不要写得像已经批了。", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
{"utterance_id": "UTT-102", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:38", "speaker_id": "P-RM-001", "speaker_name": "张伟", "text": "一定。所有方案都会标明待核实和待审批条件。", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
{"utterance_id": "UTT-103", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:40", "speaker_id": "P-RM-001", "speaker_name": "张伟", "text": "今天我跟您约的时间差不多了。最后我再复述一次双方下一步，避免后面理解不一致。", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
{"utterance_id": "UTT-104", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:41", "speaker_id": "P-RM-001", "speaker_name": "张伟", "text": "王总7月10日前发设备清单和付款节奏；我行7月14日前出三年期结构建议，分别看集团和项目公司路径；交易银行补付款工具对照。除此之外，项目最终主体和现有额度用途我们继续核实。", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
{"utterance_id": "UTT-105", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:42", "speaker_id": "C-CFO-001", "speaker_name": "李明", "text": "可以。", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
{"utterance_id": "UTT-106", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:42", "speaker_id": "C-FIN-001", "speaker_name": "王强", "text": "我后天先给初稿。", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
{"utterance_id": "UTT-107", "interaction_id": "INT-20260708", "time": "15:43", "speaker_id": "P-RM-001", "speaker_name": "张伟", "text": "好。谢谢两位，后续有任何变化先告诉我，我这边会按最新材料更新，不会每次从头再问。", "source_mode": "GOLD_STANDARD_RECONSTRUCTION", "production_input": false}
